    "Today Andorrans listen to the same Spanish, French, and international pop, rock, and electronic music as their neighbors, and the country even takes part in the Eurovision Song Contest. A small local scene of bands and singers performs in Catalan, Spanish, and English. So this mountain microstate mixes its cherished festival dances with the wider pop world just over its borders."
